	(descr "Generic 16x4 HD44780 character LCD module, board-side 1x16 socket pads. Outline 87.0 x 60.0, holes 82.0 x 55.0 (2.5 mm in), pin pitch 2.54: per Vishay LCD-016N004A (doc 37305, rev 09-Oct-12; Winstar WH1604A shows same 87x60 / 82x55). NOTE datasheet puts pin 1 at 10.0 mm from left edge, 2.5 mm from top (not 8.0). Origin = pad 1. Holes are NPTH 2.7 for M2.5. VERIFY against the Samsung SMC1640A module.")
